    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Platinum-selling crooner and five-time Juno Award nominee Matt Dusk returns to the spotlight this holiday season with A Very Sinatra Christmas, a festive and unforgettable concert experience coming to 22 cities from coast to coast. Backed by a powerhouse big band, Dusk will transport audiences to the golden age of swing, blending timeless holiday classics with the unforgettable style of the one-and-only Frank Sinatra. From “It’s the Most Wonderful Time of the Year” to “The Christmas Song”, A Very Sinatra Christmas is brimming with nostalgia, glamour, and holiday spirit — perfect for fans of classic music and unforgettable live entertainment. “There’s nothing like the magic of the holidays — and no better way to celebrate than with the music of Sinatra and a big band,” says Dusk. “Expect a swinging night of Christmas favourites, timeless charm, and maybe even a little snowfall on stage!” Known for his smooth, soulful vocals and magnetic stage presence, Dusk has become one of the world’s most beloved Crooners! Renowned for his remarkable ability to merge the timeless elegance of classic jazz with fresh, contemporary sounds, he burst onto the international music scene with his 2004 debut Two Shots, followed by a string of chart-topping [&hellip;]"
