        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "article"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Ô-Celli Goes to the Movies - Confederation Centre of the Arts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "CONFEDERATION CENTRE PRESENTS Ô-Celli Goes to the Movies — Iconic film themes, elevated by eight cellos. With Ô-Celli Goes to the Movies, the ensemble returns to its roots while paying a remarkable tribute to the art of cinema. In this new program, the magic shines brighter than ever as they perform the arrangements that marked their early years, alongside iconic themes from films such as La Strada, E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial, and Harry Potter, to name just a few. Ô-Celli captivates audiences by pushing the boundaries of the cello and inviting listeners on a truly singular journey. The extraordinary union of eight cellos creates a cathedral-like sonic dimension, promising to leave audiences spellbound long after the final note has faded. Facebook Website"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
