        "@value": "Adult Improv - Confederation Centre of the Arts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A lively and laughter-filled workshop designed for adults! Discover the joy of improvisation through simple, engaging games and storytelling exercises that spark creativity, boost confidence, and foster connection—no experience needed. This welcoming session invites you to play, explore, and embrace the unexpected in a relaxed and supportive environment. Whether you’re a longtime improv fan or trying it for the first time, come ready to laugh, share, and create unforgettable moments together! No scripts, no pressure—just pure fun! Dates: November 6th (no class on December 11) ending December 18. Time: 6:30pm – 8:00pm Day: Friday Ages: 18+ Register Here"
      }
    ],
